(7779333, 1293916, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Nicely scene and captured.  The slow shutter make the foreground water both active and serene at the same time.  Thee gulls and person really add to the image by allowing the eye to move to them.  On not would be the two dark cloud lines in the upper left.  Maybe clone them out to keep the sky cleaner.</td>', 'Nicely scene and captured.  The slow shutter make the foreground water both active and serene at the same time.  Thee gulls and person really add to the image by allowing the eye to move to them.  On not would be the two dark cloud lines in the upper left.  Maybe clone them out to keep the sky cleaner.', '2025-04-08 16:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779334, 1294000, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Very ethereal.  Usually having dead black and bright white in needed in a B&amp;W.  This seems to embrace all the grays and it really sets the mood and the mystery.  There is a texture or noise in the sky.  While that may be intentionally artistic, I found it a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Very ethereal.  Usually having dead black and bright white in needed in a B&W.  This seems to embrace all the grays and it really sets the mood and the mystery.  There is a texture or noise in the sky.  While that may be intentionally artistic, I found it a bit of a distraction.', '2025-04-08 16:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779356, 1293988, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Interesting fractals of black and white to explore.  Hard to understand what I am looking at at first.  Almost looks like a sky shot of a ski mountain.  The I see the shadow of the piper. Perhaps a little too much grey that dominates the image rather the deep blacks and bright whites.</td>', 'Interesting fractals of black and white to explore.  Hard to understand what I am looking at at first.  Almost looks like a sky shot of a ski mountain.  The I see the shadow of the piper. Perhaps a little too much grey that dominates the image rather the deep blacks and bright whites.', '2025-04-09 08:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779358, 1293991, 99263, '<td valign="top">
Zebra''s always make for such fascinating images and this is no exception. I would have cropped this a bit differently though. Have a look at what it looks like if you crop from the top down to just where the bottom part of the ear starts forming above the eye.... IMO it makes for a more striking and simple composition as it eliminates the intrusion of the ear in an otherwise perfect and harmonious abstract of Zebra stripes.</td>', 'Zebra''s always make for such fascinating images and this is no exception. I would have cropped this a bit differently though. Have a look at what it looks like if you crop from the top down to just where the bottom part of the ear starts forming above the eye.... IMO it makes for a more striking and simple composition as it eliminates the intrusion of the ear in an otherwise perfect and harmonious abstract of Zebra stripes.', '2025-04-09 08:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
